      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Greedy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Heap / counting</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/task-scheduler/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 621</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Task Scheduler</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Only the most frequent task decides the idle time: it fixes (top - 1) full rows of n + 1 slots plus one row for the labels that tie with it, and if the other tasks overflow that frame there is no idle at all. Answer = max(tasks, (top - 1)(n + 1) + width). O(n) time, O(26) space.</p>\n"
